  "details": "Alright, if you're scrolling around here you might wanna read this cause it probably deserves your upvote if it's possible.\nRight now, audio limits on avatars are kinda harsh, especially when you consider avatar ranking. Many avatars that are medium really do feel like they're only capable of very little because they only allow 8 sources of audio, and well, they kind of are. \nBut what if you could have a way to organize ALL your sound effects into ONE audio source? Perhaps it could be done with an oficially VRChat supported or developed script to make it so when an audio is enabled it starts at the fifth second of it instead of the first or something, it'd add much more potential to avatar creation and be an opportunity to kill off the headache of working around only having 8 audios for very complex avatars by creators who really do care about optimization. It's perhaps a topic about avatar creation that should be addressed a lot more since it's something that can make many avatars that much more immersive.",
